    <briefdescription>
<para>Auto-batching buffer for vector index operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Automatically buffers single vector inserts and flushes them as batches. Thread-safe, with configurable size and time thresholds.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">VectorAutoBufferConfig<sp/>config;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.max_vectors_per_buffer<sp/>=<sp/>500;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.flush_interval<sp/>=<sp/>std::chrono::seconds(10);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.compression<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_vector_auto_buffer_config_1a2d5c460b71db38ee5f422af3640c1b8aab7e881a926255afb3375d882d0e80b4f" kindref="member">VectorAutoBufferConfig::Compression::Quantization_Int8</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_vector_auto_buffer_1ad4e39934b265c4c59e963bf10a432d40" kindref="member">VectorAutoBuffer</ref><sp/>buffer(vectorIndex,<sp/>config);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">buffer.start();<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Start<sp/>background<sp/>flush<sp/>thread</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Add<sp/>vectors<sp/>(will<sp/>be<sp/>buffered)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">buffer.add(entity1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">buffer.add(entity2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>vectors<sp/>are<sp/>automatically<sp/>flushed<sp/>in<sp/>batches</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">buffer.stop();<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Stop<sp/>and<sp/>flush<sp/>remaining<sp/>vectors</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
